                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Sections of EIRENE not covered by references in TSI."@en .


###  http://data.europa.eu/949/publicNetworkRoamingDetails
:publicNetworkRoamingDetails rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                             rdfs:subPropertyOf :tsiCompliantRadioDataParameter ;
                             rdf:type owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                             rdfs:domain [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
