                             <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "stable" ;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> """Danger point is defined in ERTMS/ETCS - Glossary of Terms and Abbreviations - version  4.0.0 - date 05/07/2023. For installations without ERTMS, the signalling definition is equivalent.
See: TSI OPE Appendix D2 (2.3.3), the danger point relative distance from the signal itself."""@en .


